# The road markers while a road is drawn: the end mark and a marker on each of the end's six neighbors, after the click on
# the start flag, after a step, after a step back, and none once the road is built.
# Run it on the game view with seed 1234567812345678 and size 1, under either content set:
#   --game-view --seed 1234567812345678 --size 1 --play play/road-markers.play
# On that map the castle stands at 21,4, so its flag is at 22,5. A flag goes to 27,5.
click-tile 21 4
button Flag
click-tile 27 5
button Flag
wait 0.3

button Road
click-tile 22 5
wait 0.3
shot start 22 5 3 3
click-tile 23 5
wait 0.3
shot step 23 5 3 3
click-tile 22 5
wait 0.3
shot back 22 5 3 3
click-tile 23 5
click-tile 24 5
click-tile 25 5
click-tile 26 5
click-tile 27 5
wait 0.3
expect-at 25 5 road
shot built 24 5 4 3
